Z||000000||fierospeeder||11-07-1999||08:36 PM||||I was watching ShadeTree Mechanic, the awesome show on Cable TNN.  There was a commercial about a part company and its  <A HREF="http://www.wrenchhead.com" TARGET=_blank>www.wrenchhead.com</A>    i dont know if anyone heard of this.  Check it out, its kewl go to it and select car, year engine size, and it will give you categories like fuel, ignition, suspension etc.. then click those and get parts your looking for, or typing in a part number.  Tell me what you think.  ||||reg||10
