Z||000006||fiero56||11-25-1999||08:58 AM||||Yeap,<BR>Looks like prices went up a little.  Just a couple of bucks, still pretty cheap.  I ordered a lot of stuff from them last month. Looks like I saved about $15 since I bought my parts before the price increase.  Still, I got my stuff for a lot less, took only two days for them to get it to my house, and the shipping was free. I would be willing to order from them again.||||reg||9
